* wizlogin - SUPERSEDED by wiz1up, which does the whole sequence (server, wait,
* passthrough, login). Kept for by-hand use: run it only after a passthrough server
* is up and a client is connected; it just switches echo on and starts tsmon on /wz.
echo * WizFi360 Helper - Remote login over /wz
echo ATE0>/wz
modem /wz
xmode /wz eko=1
tsmon /wz&
